    "Name": "Hatamoto-Godai HTM-30Z",
    "Details": "Another post-Blackout variant, this 'Mech is a regimental or battalion commander's unit. It uses the same chassis, engine, and armor layout as the Hatamoto-suna. Its only armament is a pair of Clan-spec ER medium lasers and a single Extended LRM-15 with three tons of ammunition. To compensate, the Hatamoto-godai is equipped with a Guardian ECM Suite, Bloodhound Active Probe, two C3 boosted master computers, and a Command Console that has been armored. To defend against incoming missile fire, it has a Clan-built Laser Anti-Missile System in the right torso.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_Hatamoto-chiG"
  },
